nd three conversations should reveal whether TG actually preserves the original attention patterns at inference. The held-out evaluation on 50 unseen conversations confirms the core finding holds—TG performs similarly to the baseline and LoRA on the Dongre metric, with the gap ratio hitting the 25-40x range.\n\nNow I'm moving to validate this on Llama-3.1-8B, starting with the base model's GAR decay pattern across its 32 layers. Once I train ThreadGate v7 on Llama with the same MSE and gate divergence setup, I expect to see training GAR in the 0.35-0.55 range with inference GAR dropping below 0.02, and the gate direction should flip in at least 75% of layers. Then I'll run the LoRA-only baseline on Llama to establish the cross-model comparison.\n\nFor the three-way evaluation, I'm comparing base, ThreadGate, and LoRA-only to see if the gap ratio holds at 20x or higher and whether gating provides any real incremental benefit. I'm also checking for the same negative cosine similarity pattern in gradient conflicts across models, and finally validating that instruction-following accuracy decay tracks with the GAR decay I'm observing.\n\nNow I'm writing out the full YAML configuration.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4806,"cache_read_input_tokens":29005,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4806},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a2798eb8-f7f1-44c1-8b40-8064e4595dc1","uuid":"4ad955f0-54bc-44b5-85ff-5acd51cead55"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014AujXa2p989dpHVKoVu3Aa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立: teacher-forcing distribution shift 是摧毁 auxiliary attention loss 泛化性的跨模型结构性障碍。\n  两个架构族 (Qwen-2.5/Llama-3.1) 独立展现相同的三阶失败链 (梯度竞争 → gate 反转 → 推理干预不足 → 30x gap)，\n  排除模型特异性解释。Held-out eval 排除数据泄漏 confound。Claims C1-C5 全部成立，论文可按 Section 9 结构原样推进。\n  冲 Main 有基础 (3.5+)，Findings 有余量。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Gradient conflict analysis (Qwen v7, 3 checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      在 v7 的 3 个 epoch checkpoint 上分别对 NTP loss 和 GAR loss 做独立 backward，\n      收集 28 层 gate 参数梯度的 cosine similarity 和 magnitude ratio。\n      验证 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是持续的、结构性的，而非训练早期暂态。\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_mean_cos_sim: -0.087\n      epoch1_mean_cos_sim: -0.062\n      epoch2_mean_cos_sim: -0.045\n      epoch0_mag_ratio: 7.8\n      epoch1_mag_ratio: 11.3\n      epoch2_mag_ratio: 14.2\n      layers_with_negative_cos_sim_epoch0: 22  # /28\n      layers_with_negative_cos_sim_epoch1: 24\n      layers_with_negative_cos_sim_epoch2: 26\n      cos_sim_std_across_layers: 0.04\n      worst_conflict_layers: \"L3, L4, L12, L14 (cos_sim < -0.12)\"\n      mag_ratio_range: \"5.2x (L27, shallow) to 19.1x (L3, deep conflict)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      cos_sim 在三个 checkpoint 上稳定为负（-0.087 → -0.045），原因：NTP loss 推动 gate→1.0\n      （保留原始 residual 以最小化 NTP 损失），GAR loss 推动 gate→0（抑制 residual 以重新路由 attention\n      到 goal tokens）。这两个目标在 gate 参数空间上方向相反。cos_sim 从 epoch0 到 epoch2 略有\n      回升（从 -0.087 到 -0.045）不是冲突缓解，而是 GAR loss 本身在 epoch2 已趋近零\n      （training GAR 已达 0.48≈target），梯度幅度下降导致 cos_sim 的分母变小、数值上略偏移。\n      magnitude ratio 从 7.8x 增长到 14.2x 则直接证实：NTP 梯度始终主导 gate 学习方向，\n      且随训练推进 GAR 梯度信号进一步萎缩（因为 MSE loss 在 target 附近梯度 → 0），\n      NTP 的主导地位反而加强。L3/L4 冲突最严重是因为这些层的 gate 值最低（0.789-0.801），\n      偏离 identity 最远，NTP 梯度回推 gate→1.0 的力度最大。\n      best 档下 26/28 层保持负 cos_sim 且 magnitude ratio 全程 ≥5x，证明梯度竞争是\n      结构性的而非暂态，直接支撑 SP2（NTP-GAR 梯度竞争的逐层量化）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-epoch gradient conflict statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Checkpoint\", \"Mean cos_sim\", \"Std cos_sim\", \"Layers cos<0\", \"Mean mag_ratio\", \"Max mag_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epoch 0 (gs 1000)\", \"-0.087\", \"0.042\", \"22/28\", \"7.8x\", \"12.1x\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 1 (gs 2000)\", \"-0.062\", \"0.038\", \"24/28\", \"11.3x\", \"16.8x\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 2 (gs 3000)\", \"-0.045\", \"0.035\", \"26/28\", \"14.2x\", \"19.1x\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Per-layer gradient conflict (Epoch 2)\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"cos_sim\", \"NTP grad norm\", \"GAR grad norm\", \"mag_ratio\", \"gate_mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L3\", \"-0.131\", \"2.4e-3\", \"1.3e-4\", \"18.5x\", \"0.801\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"-0.124\", \"2.6e-3\", \"1.4e-4\", \"18.6x\", \"0.789\"]\n          - [\"L12\", \"-0.098\", \"1.8e-3\", \"1.2e-4\", \"15.0x\", \"0.847\"]\n          - [\"L14\", \"-0.105\", \"2.0e-3\", \"1.1e-4\", \"18.2x\", \"0.928\"]\n          - [\"L23\", \"-0.072\", \"1.5e-3\", \"9.8e-5\", \"15.3x\", \"0.979\"]\n          - [\"L27\", \"-0.018\", \"8.2e-4\", \"1.6e-4\", \"5.1x\", \"0.988\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 28层 cos_sim 热力图 (x=layer, y=checkpoint)，蓝色为负（冲突），红色为正。预期几乎全蓝，仅 L26-L27 偶尔微弱正值。\"\n      - \"Fig B: magnitude ratio 折线图 (3条线=3 checkpoints, x=layer)，展示 NTP 主导程度随训练加剧。\"\n      - \"Fig C: 散点图 cos_sim vs gate_mean（per layer），预期负相关——gate 偏离 identity 越远，冲突越强。\"\n    analysis: >\n      三个 checkpoint 的一致负 cos_sim 证明 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争不是训练初期暂态，而是 joint optimization\n      的结构性特征。magnitude ratio 单调增长 (7.8→14.2x) 表明 GAR loss 在训练后期\n      因趋近 target 而梯度衰减，NTP 进一步主导 gate 参数更新方向。\n      这解释了 NF1（反向 turn conditioning）的成因：NTP 梯度持续将 gate 推向 1.0（identity），\n      尤其在晚期 turn（NTP loss 更高的位置），而 GAR 梯度在这些位置虽然方向正确但幅度远不够。\n      论文中这组数据构成 SP2 的核心证据，直接量化了 \"为什么 gate 学不到正确的 turn-selective 干预\"。\n\n  - name: \"Attention heatmap visualization (4 models × 3 convs × 28 layers)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only 四个模型，在 3 段标准对话上逐层提取 attention weight，\n      计算 goal tokens 获得的 attention 比例随 turn 的衰减曲线，可视化对比。\n    expected_results:\n      base_mean_goal_attn: 0.0136\n      base_t1_to_t10_decay: 0.875\n      tg_mean_goal_attn: 0.0148\n      tg_t1_to_t10_decay: 0.842\n      ug_mean_goal_attn: 0.0141\n      ug_t1_to_t10_decay: 0.856\n      lora_mean_goal_attn: 0.0143\n      lora_t1_to_t10_decay: 0.851\n      tg_vs_base_improvement: \"0.0012 (~8.8%), within noise\"\n      cross_layer_pattern: \"goal attn 集中于 L0-L4, L24-L27; middle layers ≈ 0\"\n      head_specialization: \"2-3 heads per layer carry >80% goal attn; rest near zero\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      推理时 gate mean = 0.93-0.98，对 residual stream 的调制仅 2-7%，远不足以改变\n      self-attention 分布。Attention 是 softmax(QK^T/√d)V，gate 作用在 residual connection\n      上（layer 间传递），不直接改 QK^T 内部权重。因此 TG 的 goal attention 仅比 Base\n      高 ~0.001 量级（0.0148 vs 0.0136），差异在统计噪声范围内。UG 和 LoRA-only 同样\n      无法改变 attention pattern，因为 LoRA 仅在 NTP 目标下训练，不会自发学习 goal-directed\n      attention。四个模型的 decay 曲线高度重叠（84-88% 衰减），视觉上几乎不可区分，\n      直接证明 NF3（推理时干预强度不足）——gating 在推理时几乎是 identity operation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Goal attention statistics across models\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Mean goal attn\", \"T1 goal attn\", \"T10 goal attn\", \"Decay %\", \"Peak layer\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.0136\", \"0.0312\", \"0.0039\", \"87.5%\", \"L1\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.0148\", \"0.0328\", \"0.0052\", \"84.2%\", \"L1\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.0141\", \"0.0318\", \"0.0046\", \"85.6%\", \"L1\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.0143\", \"0.0321\", \"0.0048\", \"85.1%\", \"L2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 4×1 subplot，每 model 一个 28-layer attention heatmap (x=turn, y=layer, color=goal_attn)。预期四图视觉几乎一致。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Goal attention decay 曲线 (x=turn, y=mean goal attn across layers)，4条线高度重叠。\"\n      - \"Fig C: Per-head goal attention 分布 (histogram)，展示 attention 集中于少数 specialized heads。\"\n    analysis: >\n      四个模型的 attention heatmap 视觉几乎不可区分，是最直观的 negative evidence。\n      这直接回答 \"推理时 gate 在做什么\"——几乎什么都没做。Gate 的 2-7% residual attenuation\n      不足以穿透 softmax 非线性改变 attention 分布。\n      论文中这组图放在 Section 7（Analysis）作为 NF3 的视觉证据，\n      与 gate profile 数据（NF1）和 30x gap 数值（NF2）形成三重交叉验证。\n\n  - name: \"Held-out evaluation (50 unseen UltraChat conversations)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      从 UltraChat 全集 idx≥8000 抽取 50 段对话（训练集 idx<8000），\n      重跑四路 eval (Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only) 的 GAR-Dongre + GAR-ours + PPL。\n      目的：排除 eval 数据与训练数据重叠的 confound，确认 negative finding 在 unseen data 上成立。\n    expected_results:\n      heldout_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.004\n      heldout_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.015\n      heldout_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.012\n      heldout_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.014\n      heldout_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.013\n      heldout_dongre_gap_ratio: 32  # training 0.48 / inference 0.015 = 32x\n      heldout_tg_minus_lora_dongre_gar: 0.001\n      heldout_tg_ppl: 2.71\n      heldout_ug_ppl: 2.69\n      heldout_lora_ppl: 2.70\n      heldout_base_ppl: 4.35\n      heldout_gar_decay_turn1_to_mid: 0.72  # similar to standard eval\n      heldout_num_conversations: 50\n      heldout_num_turns_per_conv: 10\n    result_rationale: >\n      Held-out eval 预期与 standard eval 高度一致，原因：(1) 训练数据是 UltraChat 的前 8000 段，\n      而 eval 此前用的 standard_conversations 是由 base model 生成的 5 段固定对话，\n      本身已与训练数据不同——所以 held-out 不是修正 data leakage（没有 leakage），\n      而是增加 eval 的统计功效（5→50 段）和消除 \"eval 数据太少/太特殊\" 的 reviewer 质疑。\n      (2) distribution shift 是 teacher-forcing→autoregressive 的结构性问题，\n      与 eval 数据的具体内容无关——任何多轮对话在推理时都会面临相同的 distribution mismatch。\n      (3) TG 和 LoRA-only 的 Dongre GAR 差异预期在 ±0.003 以内（实际 0.001），\n      因为 gate 在推理时是 near-identity（mean 0.93-0.98），不产生有意义的功能差异。\n      PPL 略高于 standard eval（2.71 vs 2.63）是因为 unseen conversations 的 topic 分布\n      可能略偏离训练分布，但差异很小。gap ratio 32x（相比 standard eval 的 30x）\n      在统计波动范围内，进一步确认 training-inference gap 的稳健性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Held-out 4-way evaluation results\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-Dongre mid\", \"GAR-ours mid\", \"PPL\", \"NTP loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.004\", \"0.011\", \"4.35\", \"1.43\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.015\", \"0.013\", \"2.71\", \"0.96\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.012\", \"0.012\", \"2.69\", \"0.95\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.014\", \"0.013\", \"2.70\", \"0.96\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Held-out vs Standard eval consistency\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Standard (5 convs)\", \"Held-out (50 convs)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG Dongre mid GAR\", \"0.0157\", \"0.015\", \"-0.001\"]\n          - [\"LoRA Dongre mid GAR\", \"0.0137\", \"0.014\", \"+0.000\"]\n          - [\"TG - LoRA gap\", \"+0.002\", \"+0.001\", \"-0.001\"]\n          - [\"Gap ratio (train/infer)\", \"30x\", \"32x\", \"+2x\"]\n          - [\"Base Dongre mid GAR\", \"0.003\", \"0.004\", \"+0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Held-out GAR 衰减曲线 (50段对话的 mean±std)，turn-by-turn，4条线重叠。Error bar 比 standard eval 更窄（样本量 10x）。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Held-out vs Standard eval 的 scatter plot (x=standard, y=held-out)，每点一个 model×metric，预期高度沿对角线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      50 段 held-out 对话确认：(1) TG Dongre GAR 0.015 与 standard eval 的 0.016 一致（±0.001），\n      training-inference gap ratio 32x；(2) TG - LoRA 差异 = 0.001，在 ±0.003 range 内，\n      gating 零增量贡献；(3) PPL 结果同样一致。\n      更大样本量使 error bar 收窄，增强了 \"gating 无效\" 结论的统计信度。\n      论文中这组数据放在 Section 6 作为 robustness check，\n      回应 reviewer 对 eval 数据过少/过拟合的潜在质疑。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR degradation diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 上运行 Phase 1 GAR 诊断，使用相同的 standard_conversations\n      （需适配 Llama-3 chat template），确认 GAR 衰减在不同架构族上存在。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_turn1_avg_gar: 0.0385\n      llama3_mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0098\n      llama3_relative_drop: 0.745\n      llama3_per_turn_avg_gar: [0.0385, 0.0218, 0.0195, 0.0108, 0.0115, 0.0072, 0.0064, 0.0068, 0.0131, 0.0051]\n      llama3_num_layers: 32\n      llama3_vs_qwen_drop_delta: \"+3.7pp (74.5% vs 70.8%)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 与 Qwen-2.5-7B 参数量相近（8B vs 7B）但架构不同\n      （GQA vs MHA、RoPE 实现差异、不同 pre-training 数据）。GAR 衰减是 autoregressive\n      transformer 在长 context 下的通用现象——随 turn 增加，goal tokens 在 KV cache 中的\n      positional recency 下降，attention softmax 自然稀释 goal attention。\n      因此 Llama 预期展现同等甚至略强的衰减（74.5% vs 70.8%），因为 GQA 的 shared KV heads\n      可能进一步压缩 per-head goal representation capacity。\n      turn-by-turn 趋势预期高度相似：turn 1 最高，turn 2-3 快速下降，turn 4+ 趋于平台。\n      这直接支撑 C1 的跨模型泛化：GAR 衰减不是 Qwen 特有的，而是 transformer attention 的通用特征。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 vs Qwen Phase 1 GAR comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Turn\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B GAR\", \"Llama-3.1-8B GAR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"T1\", \"0.0418\", \"0.0385\"]\n          - [\"T2\", \"0.0241\", \"0.0218\"]\n          - [\"T3\", \"0.0224\", \"0.0195\"]\n          - [\"T4\", \"0.0130\", \"0.0108\"]\n          - [\"T5\", \"0.0133\", \"0.0115\"]\n          - [\"T6\", \"0.0086\", \"0.0072\"]\n          - [\"T7\", \"0.0078\", \"0.0064\"]\n          - [\"T8\", \"0.0080\", \"0.0068\"]\n          - [\"T9\", \"0.0157\", \"0.0131\"]\n          - [\"T10\", \"0.0064\", \"0.0051\"]\n          - [\"Mid avg\", \"0.0122\", \"0.0098\"]\n          - [\"Relative drop\", \"70.8%\", \"74.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 双模型 GAR 衰减曲线 (x=turn, y=GAR)，两条线形状几乎平行，Llama 略低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 的 74.5% GAR 衰减与 Qwen 的 70.8% 高度一致，\n      确认 GAR 衰减是跨架构族的通用现象。轻微差异（+3.7pp）在模型差异预期范围内。\n      这为后续跨模型 gating 实验建立了 baseline。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 Qwen v7 的完整训练 setup (MSE+gate_div, 3 epochs)，\n      验证训练收敛 + 推理失败的 pattern 跨模型复现。Llama 有 32 层（vs Qwen 28 层）。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_training_gar_peak: 0.42\n      llama3_final_avg_ntp: 0.91\n      llama3_final_avg_gar_loss: 0.001\n      llama3_final_gate_mean: 0.941\n      llama3_final_gate_std: 0.045\n      llama3_final_gate_min: 0.802\n      llama3_final_gate_max: 0.991\n      llama3_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-90):plateau@0.02 B(gs90-170):rapid_rise C(gs170+):converged@0.42\"\n      llama3_training_time_hours: 6.8\n      llama3_reversed_layers: 26  # /32\n      llama3_reversed_layers_frac: 0.8125\n      llama3_eval_dongre_mid_gar: 0.012\n      llama3_eval_ours_mid_gar: 0.013\n      llama3_inference_gap_ratio: 35  # 0.42 / 0.012 = 35x\n      llama3_gate_direction: \"WRONG: same reversal as Qwen\"\n      llama3_gate_dynamic_range_top3:\n        L25: { turn1: 0.782, turn21: 0.976, diff: -0.194 }\n        L16: { turn1: 0.761, turn21: 0.935, diff: -0.174 }\n        L8: { turn1: 0.831, turn21: 0.952, diff: -0.121 }\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3 training GAR peak 预期为 0.42（略低于 Qwen 的 0.48），原因：\n      (1) Llama-3 的 GQA (8 KV heads vs Qwen 的 28 full MHA heads) 意味着 gate 对 attention\n      的间接影响路径更窄——每个 KV head 服务多个 query head，gate 调制 residual stream 后，\n      attention shift 需要穿透 GQA 的 sharing 结构，效率略低；\n      (2) Llama 的 RoPE 频率不同，positional encoding 与 Qwen 的 NTK-aware RoPE 不同，\n      可能影响 turn-boundary 位置信号的传播。\n      但 MSE+gate_div loss 的核心动力学不依赖具体架构——bidirectional MSE 在任何可微分 gate\n      上都能驱动 training GAR 趋向 target，gate_div 防止 collapse。因此训练仍然收敛。\n      推理时 GAR = 0.012 极低（gap ratio 35x），原因与 Qwen 相同：teacher-forcing 训练的\n      attention pattern 不迁移到 autoregressive generation。\n      Gate direction 反转（26/32 层）同样复现 NF1，因为 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是 joint optimization\n      的通用特征，不依赖特定架构。收敛速度略慢（gs170 vs gs144）是因为 32 层的参数空间更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 vs Qwen v7 training comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Num layers\", \"28\", \"32\"]\n          - [\"Attention type\", \"MHA (28 heads)\", \"GQA (32q/8kv)\"]\n          - [\"Training GAR peak\", \"0.48\", \"0.42\"]\n          - [\"GAR convergence step\", \"gs144\", \"gs170\"]\n          - [\"Final gate mean\", \"0.934\", \"0.941\"]\n          - [\"Final NTP loss\", \"0.896\", \"0.910\"]\n          - [\"Inference Dongre GAR\", \"0.016\", \"0.012\"]\n          - [\"Gap ratio\", \"30x\", \"35x\"]\n          - [\"Reversed layers\", \"27/28 (96%)\", \"26/32 (81%)\"]\n          - [\"Training time\", \"5.9h\", \"6.8h\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 gate profile top-5 reversed layers\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"Turn1 gate\", \"Turn21 gate\", \"Diff\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L25\", \"0.782\", \"0.976\", \"-0.194\"]\n          - [\"L16\", \"0.761\", \"0.935\", \"-0.174\"]\n          - [\"L8\", \"0.831\", \"0.952\", \"-0.121\"]\n          - [\"L12\", \"0.845\", \"0.961\", \"-0.116\"]\n          - [\"L5\", \"0.868\", \"0.973\", \"-0.105\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Llama-3 training GAR 曲线，展示同样的三阶段动力学 (plateau → rapid rise → convergence)。与 Qwen 曲线并列对比。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Llama-3 per-layer gate profile (turn1 vs turn21)，32 层中 26 层展现反向 turn conditioning。\"\n      - \"Fig C: 双模型 gate reversal 对比 bar chart (每层 diff)，形状相似但 Llama 有更多层可比较。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 完整复现了 Qwen 的三阶失败链：训练收敛（GAR 0.42）→ 推理失败（GAR 0.012，35x gap）→\n      gate 方向反转（81% 层）。training GAR 略低和 reversed fraction 略低（81% vs 96%）\n      与 GQA 架构差异一致，但核心 pattern 相同。这是跨模型验证的核心数据，\n      直接证明 distribution shift 是架构无关的结构性障碍（C5）。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上训练 LoRA-only baseline（无 gate，gate 固定为 1.0），\n      作为跨模型消融的对照组，隔离 gating 机制的增量贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_lora_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_lora_global_steps: 3000\n      llama3_lora_training_time_hours: 6.2\n      llama3_lora_final_ntp_loss: 0.908\n      llama3_lora_size_mb: 20\n      llama3_lora_gate_type: \"none (fixed 1.0)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 在 Llama 上的训练行为应与 Qwen 完全对称：纯 NTP 优化，无 GAR auxiliary loss。\n      NTP loss 收敛到相似水平（0.908 vs Qwen 的 0.948）——Llama 基础 NTP 略低是因为\n      Llama-3.1 的 pre-training 数据质量和规模不同。训练时间略长（6.2h vs 5.7h）是\n      因为 32 层（vs 28 层）带来更多 LoRA 参数。\n      这个实验本身不产生新 insight，但为 plan_012 的三路 eval 提供必要 baseline。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LoRA-only training comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epochs\", \"3\", \"3\"]\n          - [\"Final NTP loss\", \"0.948\", \"0.908\"]\n          - [\"Training time\", \"5.7h\", \"6.2h\"]\n          - [\"LoRA size\", \"20MB\", \"20MB\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练正常完成，为 plan_012 的三路 eval 提供 LoRA-only baseline checkpoint。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-way eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上用 held-out 数据执行三路 eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)，\n      计算 GAR-Dongre + GAR-ours + PPL。验证 gating 零增量贡献跨模型成立。\n      注意：Llama 跳过 UG 消融（Qwen 已证明 UG≈TG≈LoRA，跨模型只需确认核心 pattern）。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.003\n      llama3_base_ppl: 4.51\n      llama3_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.012\n      llama3_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.011\n      llama3_tg_ppl: 2.78\n      llama3_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.013\n      llama3_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.012\n      llama3_lora_ppl: 2.76\n      llama3_tg_minus_lora_dongre_gar: -0.001\n      llama3_gap_ratio: 35  # training 0.42 / inference 0.012\n      llama3_gating_incremental_benefit: \"none\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3 eval 预期精确复现 Qwen 的核心 pattern：\n      (1) Base GAR 极低（0.003），与 Qwen base（0.003）一致——这是 untrained model 在 Dongre\n      定义下的 GAR floor，主要由 random attention 决定；\n      (2) TG 和 LoRA-only 的 Dongre GAR 差异 = -0.001，在 ±0.003 range 内——\n      因为推理时 gate 是 near-identity（0.94），功能上等价于 LoRA-only；\n      (3) PPL 在三个 trained model 间几乎相同（2.76-2.78），因为 NTP loss 主导训练，\n      gate 对 NTP 的影响 <0.5%。\n      Gap ratio 35x（训练 0.42 / 推理 0.012）比 Qwen 的 30x 略大，\n      与 Llama GQA 架构下 attention pattern 更难被间接调制一致。\n      这组数据与 Qwen 的四路 eval 联合，构成 C4+C5 的跨模型证据：\n      gating 在两个架构族上都没有增量贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 3-way eval\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-Dongre mid\", \"GAR-ours mid\", \"PPL\", \"NTP loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.003\", \"0.009\", \"4.51\", \"1.46\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.012\", \"0.011\", \"2.78\", \"0.92\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.013\", \"0.012\", \"2.76\", \"0.91\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model gating contribution summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG Dongre GAR\", \"0.016\", \"0.012\"]\n          - [\"LoRA Dongre GAR\", \"0.014\", \"0.013\"]\n          - [\"TG - LoRA\", \"+0.002\", \"-0.001\"]\n          - [\"Gap ratio\", \"30x\", \"35x\"]\n          - [\"Gating benefit\", \"none\", \"none\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Cross-model 4-panel comparison: Qwen 四路 + Llama 三路的 GAR 衰减曲线并列。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Gap ratio bar chart (Qwen 30x vs Llama 35x)，展示跨模型一致性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 三路 eval 确认跨模型结论：gating 零增量贡献（TG - LoRA = -0.001），\n      gap ratio 35x。两个架构族的 convergent evidence 直接回应 W1（单模型弱点），\n      将论文从 \"单模型 observation\" 升级为 \"跨架构 structural finding\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B gradient conflict analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3 v7 checkpoint 上执行梯度冲突分析，验证 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争跨模型成立。\n      32 层 × 至少 1 个 checkpoint（优先 epoch 2 final）。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_epoch2_mean_cos_sim: -0.058\n      llama3_epoch2_layers_negative: 27  # /32\n      llama3_epoch2_mean_mag_ratio: 12.8\n      llama3_epoch2_max_mag_ratio: 18.5\n      llama3_worst_conflict_layers: \"L5, L8, L12, L16\"\n      llama3_cos_sim_std: 0.038\n    result_rationale: >\n      NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是 joint optimization 的通用属性：NTP 推 gate→1.0（minimize 对 residual\n      的干扰），GAR 推 gate→0（maximize attention redistribution）。这个对抗不依赖\n      具体的 attention 实现（MHA vs GQA）或 positional encoding（RoPE variant），\n      因为它发生在 gate parameter space 而非 attention space。\n      Llama 的 mean cos_sim (-0.058) 与 Qwen (-0.045) 同级，略更负可能因为 GQA 架构下\n      GAR loss 对 gate 的间接梯度路径更复杂（穿透 shared KV heads），\n      导致梯度方向偏移更大。mag_ratio 12.8x 在 Qwen 的 14.2x 附近，\n      反映类似的 NTP 主导程度。27/32 层负 cos_sim（84%）与 Qwen 的 26/28（93%）\n      在同一 range，略低因为 Llama 有更多 \"浅层\" gate（L28-L31）受 GAR 影响更弱、\n      cos_sim 可能为微弱正值。\n      跨模型梯度数据联合构成 SP2 的完整证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model gradient conflict comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B (ep2)\", \"Llama-3.1-8B (ep2)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Mean cos_sim\", \"-0.045\", \"-0.058\"]\n          - [\"Std cos_sim\", \"0.035\", \"0.038\"]\n          - [\"Layers cos<0\", \"26/28 (93%)\", \"27/32 (84%)\"]\n          - [\"Mean mag_ratio\", \"14.2x\", \"12.8x\"]\n          - [\"Max mag_ratio\", \"19.1x\", \"18.5x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 双模型 per-layer cos_sim bar chart (Qwen 28层 vs Llama 32层)，均以 y=0 为分界，负值标蓝。\"\n      - \"Fig B: 双模型 mag_ratio 曲线叠加，展示 NTP 主导程度跨模型一致。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 梯度冲突 pattern 与 Qwen 高度一致（cos_sim 同为负，mag_ratio 同量级），\n      证明 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是 joint NTP+auxiliary loss 训练的通用特征（不依赖特定架构）。\n      这是 \"distribution shift 是结构性的\" 论证的梯度层面证据。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream task sanity check (instruction retention)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      设计简单下游任务：在 system prompt 给出格式指令（如 \"每次回复以 [DONE] 结尾\"），\n      测试 4 个模型在 10 turn 对话中遵循该指令的比例。验证 GAR 衰减与可观察的任务性能退化相关联。\n    expected_results:\n      task_type: \"instruction_retention_rate\"\n      num_instructions: 5\n      num_conversations_per_instruction: 10\n      num_turns: 10\n      base_turn1_compliance: 0.82\n      base_turn10_compliance: 0.34\n      base_compliance_drop: 0.585  # (0.82-0.34)/0.82\n      tg_turn1_compliance: 0.84\n      tg_turn10_compliance: 0.36\n      tg_compliance_drop: 0.571\n      lora_turn1_compliance: 0.84\n      lora_turn10_compliance: 0.35\n      lora_compliance_drop: 0.583\n      gar_compliance_correlation: 0.89  # Pearson r between GAR and compliance across turns\n      tg_vs_lora_compliance_diff: \"+1pp (noise)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      System prompt instruction compliance 随 turn 下降是 GAR 衰减的直接行为后果：\n      model 的 attention 越来越难访问 system prompt 中的 goal tokens，\n      导致格式指令的 \"记忆\" 衰退。Base model compliance 从 82% 降到 34%（~59% drop）\n      与 GAR 70.8% drop 趋势一致（compliance drop 略小是因为 residual stream 仍保留部分\n      goal info，即使 attention 衰减，model 仍有概率通过 MLP/skip connection 间接访问）。\n      TG 和 LoRA-only 的 compliance 几乎相同（36% vs 35%），因为推理时 gate 是 near-identity，\n      不影响实际生成行为。GAR-compliance 相关系数 0.89 建立了 GAR 作为 proxy metric 的\n      behavioral validity，回应 W3（GAR 是否与真实任务性能相关）。\n      best 档下这个相关性足够高（>0.85）使 reviewer 接受 GAR 作为合理 proxy。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction compliance across turns\"\n        columns: [\"Turn\", \"Base\", \"TG\", \"LoRA-only\", \"Mean GAR (Base)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"T1\", \"0.82\", \"0.84\", \"0.84\", \"0.042\"]\n          - [\"T2\", \"0.74\", \"0.76\", \"0.75\", \"0.024\"]\n          - [\"T3\", \"0.68\", \"0.69\", \"0.68\", \"0.022\"]\n          - [\"T4\", \"0.62\", \"0.63\", \"0.62\", \"0.013\"]\n          - [\"T5\", \"0.56\", \"0.57\", \"0.56\", \"0.013\"]\n          - [\"T6\", \"0.50\", \"0.51\", \"0.50\", \"0.009\"]\n          - [\"T7\", \"0.44\", \"0.45\", \"0.44\", \"0.008\"]\n          - [\"T8\", \"0.40\", \"0.42\", \"0.41\", \"0.008\"]\n          - [\"T9\", \"0.38\", \"0.39\", \"0.38\", \"0.016\"]\n          - [\"T10\", \"0.34\", \"0.36\", \"0.35\", \"0.006\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Compliance-GAR correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Pearson r\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.89\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.87\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.88\", \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Dual-axis plot: compliance rate (左轴, bars) + GAR (右轴, line) across turns, 展示同步衰减。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Scatter plot GAR vs compliance (per turn, per model)，regression line + r² annotation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Instruction compliance 随 turn 衰减 (~59%) 与 GAR 衰减 (~71%) 同步，Pearson r = 0.89，\n      建立 GAR 作为 behavioral proxy 的 empirical validity。关键是 TG 和 LoRA-only\n      的 compliance 几乎相同（Δ ≈ 1pp），与 GAR 结论一致——gating 不改善实际任务表现。\n      这组数据回应 W3（GAR 是否代表真实性能），建议放在 Section 6 或 Appendix 作为\n      supplementary evidence。注意这不是 comprehensive downstream eval，\n      而是 sanity check，论文中需要诚实地定位为 \"preliminary behavioral validation\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4806,"cache_read_input_tokens":29005,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4806},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a2798eb8-f7f1-44c1-8b40-8064e4595dc1","uuid":"ed70d77e-ffd5-4648-8e8a-f74d12ebd5b6"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":347526,"duration_api_ms":347921,"num_turns":2,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立: teacher-forcing distribution shift 是摧毁 auxiliary attention loss 泛化性的跨模型结构性障碍。\n  两个架构族 (Qwen-2.5/Llama-3.1) 独立展现相同的三阶失败链 (梯度竞争 → gate 反转 → 推理干预不足 → 30x gap)，\n  排除模型特异性解释。Held-out eval 排除数据泄漏 confound。Claims C1-C5 全部成立，论文可按 Section 9 结构原样推进。\n  冲 Main 有基础 (3.5+)，Findings 有余量。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Gradient conflict analysis (Qwen v7, 3 checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      在 v7 的 3 个 epoch checkpoint 上分别对 NTP loss 和 GAR loss 做独立 backward，\n      收集 28 层 gate 参数梯度的 cosine similarity 和 magnitude ratio。\n      验证 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是持续的、结构性的，而非训练早期暂态。\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_mean_cos_sim: -0.087\n      epoch1_mean_cos_sim: -0.062\n      epoch2_mean_cos_sim: -0.045\n      epoch0_mag_ratio: 7.8\n      epoch1_mag_ratio: 11.3\n      epoch2_mag_ratio: 14.2\n      layers_with_negative_cos_sim_epoch0: 22  # /28\n      layers_with_negative_cos_sim_epoch1: 24\n      layers_with_negative_cos_sim_epoch2: 26\n      cos_sim_std_across_layers: 0.04\n      worst_conflict_layers: \"L3, L4, L12, L14 (cos_sim < -0.12)\"\n      mag_ratio_range: \"5.2x (L27, shallow) to 19.1x (L3, deep conflict)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      cos_sim 在三个 checkpoint 上稳定为负（-0.087 → -0.045），原因：NTP loss 推动 gate→1.0\n      （保留原始 residual 以最小化 NTP 损失），GAR loss 推动 gate→0（抑制 residual 以重新路由 attention\n      到 goal tokens）。这两个目标在 gate 参数空间上方向相反。cos_sim 从 epoch0 到 epoch2 略有\n      回升（从 -0.087 到 -0.045）不是冲突缓解，而是 GAR loss 本身在 epoch2 已趋近零\n      （training GAR 已达 0.48≈target），梯度幅度下降导致 cos_sim 的分母变小、数值上略偏移。\n      magnitude ratio 从 7.8x 增长到 14.2x 则直接证实：NTP 梯度始终主导 gate 学习方向，\n      且随训练推进 GAR 梯度信号进一步萎缩（因为 MSE loss 在 target 附近梯度 → 0），\n      NTP 的主导地位反而加强。L3/L4 冲突最严重是因为这些层的 gate 值最低（0.789-0.801），\n      偏离 identity 最远，NTP 梯度回推 gate→1.0 的力度最大。\n      best 档下 26/28 层保持负 cos_sim 且 magnitude ratio 全程 ≥5x，证明梯度竞争是\n      结构性的而非暂态，直接支撑 SP2（NTP-GAR 梯度竞争的逐层量化）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-epoch gradient conflict statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Checkpoint\", \"Mean cos_sim\", \"Std cos_sim\", \"Layers cos<0\", \"Mean mag_ratio\", \"Max mag_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epoch 0 (gs 1000)\", \"-0.087\", \"0.042\", \"22/28\", \"7.8x\", \"12.1x\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 1 (gs 2000)\", \"-0.062\", \"0.038\", \"24/28\", \"11.3x\", \"16.8x\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 2 (gs 3000)\", \"-0.045\", \"0.035\", \"26/28\", \"14.2x\", \"19.1x\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Per-layer gradient conflict (Epoch 2)\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"cos_sim\", \"NTP grad norm\", \"GAR grad norm\", \"mag_ratio\", \"gate_mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L3\", \"-0.131\", \"2.4e-3\", \"1.3e-4\", \"18.5x\", \"0.801\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"-0.124\", \"2.6e-3\", \"1.4e-4\", \"18.6x\", \"0.789\"]\n          - [\"L12\", \"-0.098\", \"1.8e-3\", \"1.2e-4\", \"15.0x\", \"0.847\"]\n          - [\"L14\", \"-0.105\", \"2.0e-3\", \"1.1e-4\", \"18.2x\", \"0.928\"]\n          - [\"L23\", \"-0.072\", \"1.5e-3\", \"9.8e-5\", \"15.3x\", \"0.979\"]\n          - [\"L27\", \"-0.018\", \"8.2e-4\", \"1.6e-4\", \"5.1x\", \"0.988\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 28层 cos_sim 热力图 (x=layer, y=checkpoint)，蓝色为负（冲突），红色为正。预期几乎全蓝，仅 L26-L27 偶尔微弱正值。\"\n      - \"Fig B: magnitude ratio 折线图 (3条线=3 checkpoints, x=layer)，展示 NTP 主导程度随训练加剧。\"\n      - \"Fig C: 散点图 cos_sim vs gate_mean（per layer），预期负相关——gate 偏离 identity 越远，冲突越强。\"\n    analysis: >\n      三个 checkpoint 的一致负 cos_sim 证明 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争不是训练初期暂态，而是 joint optimization\n      的结构性特征。magnitude ratio 单调增长 (7.8→14.2x) 表明 GAR loss 在训练后期\n      因趋近 target 而梯度衰减，NTP 进一步主导 gate 参数更新方向。\n      这解释了 NF1（反向 turn conditioning）的成因：NTP 梯度持续将 gate 推向 1.0（identity），\n      尤其在晚期 turn（NTP loss 更高的位置），而 GAR 梯度在这些位置虽然方向正确但幅度远不够。\n      论文中这组数据构成 SP2 的核心证据，直接量化了 \"为什么 gate 学不到正确的 turn-selective 干预\"。\n\n  - name: \"Attention heatmap visualization (4 models × 3 convs × 28 layers)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only 四个模型，在 3 段标准对话上逐层提取 attention weight，\n      计算 goal tokens 获得的 attention 比例随 turn 的衰减曲线，可视化对比。\n    expected_results:\n      base_mean_goal_attn: 0.0136\n      base_t1_to_t10_decay: 0.875\n      tg_mean_goal_attn: 0.0148\n      tg_t1_to_t10_decay: 0.842\n      ug_mean_goal_attn: 0.0141\n      ug_t1_to_t10_decay: 0.856\n      lora_mean_goal_attn: 0.0143\n      lora_t1_to_t10_decay: 0.851\n      tg_vs_base_improvement: \"0.0012 (~8.8%), within noise\"\n      cross_layer_pattern: \"goal attn 集中于 L0-L4, L24-L27; middle layers ≈ 0\"\n      head_specialization: \"2-3 heads per layer carry >80% goal attn; rest near zero\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      推理时 gate mean = 0.93-0.98，对 residual stream 的调制仅 2-7%，远不足以改变\n      self-attention 分布。Attention 是 softmax(QK^T/√d)V，gate 作用在 residual connection\n      上（layer 间传递），不直接改 QK^T 内部权重。因此 TG 的 goal attention 仅比 Base\n      高 ~0.001 量级（0.0148 vs 0.0136），差异在统计噪声范围内。UG 和 LoRA-only 同样\n      无法改变 attention pattern，因为 LoRA 仅在 NTP 目标下训练，不会自发学习 goal-directed\n      attention。四个模型的 decay 曲线高度重叠（84-88% 衰减），视觉上几乎不可区分，\n      直接证明 NF3（推理时干预强度不足）——gating 在推理时几乎是 identity operation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Goal attention statistics across models\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Mean goal attn\", \"T1 goal attn\", \"T10 goal attn\", \"Decay %\", \"Peak layer\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.0136\", \"0.0312\", \"0.0039\", \"87.5%\", \"L1\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.0148\", \"0.0328\", \"0.0052\", \"84.2%\", \"L1\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.0141\", \"0.0318\", \"0.0046\", \"85.6%\", \"L1\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.0143\", \"0.0321\", \"0.0048\", \"85.1%\", \"L2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 4×1 subplot，每 model 一个 28-layer attention heatmap (x=turn, y=layer, color=goal_attn)。预期四图视觉几乎一致。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Goal attention decay 曲线 (x=turn, y=mean goal attn across layers)，4条线高度重叠。\"\n      - \"Fig C: Per-head goal attention 分布 (histogram)，展示 attention 集中于少数 specialized heads。\"\n    analysis: >\n      四个模型的 attention heatmap 视觉几乎不可区分，是最直观的 negative evidence。\n      这直接回答 \"推理时 gate 在做什么\"——几乎什么都没做。Gate 的 2-7% residual attenuation\n      不足以穿透 softmax 非线性改变 attention 分布。\n      论文中这组图放在 Section 7（Analysis）作为 NF3 的视觉证据，\n      与 gate profile 数据（NF1）和 30x gap 数值（NF2）形成三重交叉验证。\n\n  - name: \"Held-out evaluation (50 unseen UltraChat conversations)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      从 UltraChat 全集 idx≥8000 抽取 50 段对话（训练集 idx<8000），\n      重跑四路 eval (Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only) 的 GAR-Dongre + GAR-ours + PPL。\n      目的：排除 eval 数据与训练数据重叠的 confound，确认 negative finding 在 unseen data 上成立。\n    expected_results:\n      heldout_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.004\n      heldout_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.015\n      heldout_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.012\n      heldout_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.014\n      heldout_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.013\n      heldout_dongre_gap_ratio: 32  # training 0.48 / inference 0.015 = 32x\n      heldout_tg_minus_lora_dongre_gar: 0.001\n      heldout_tg_ppl: 2.71\n      heldout_ug_ppl: 2.69\n      heldout_lora_ppl: 2.70\n      heldout_base_ppl: 4.35\n      heldout_gar_decay_turn1_to_mid: 0.72  # similar to standard eval\n      heldout_num_conversations: 50\n      heldout_num_turns_per_conv: 10\n    result_rationale: >\n      Held-out eval 预期与 standard eval 高度一致，原因：(1) 训练数据是 UltraChat 的前 8000 段，\n      而 eval 此前用的 standard_conversations 是由 base model 生成的 5 段固定对话，\n      本身已与训练数据不同——所以 held-out 不是修正 data leakage（没有 leakage），\n      而是增加 eval 的统计功效（5→50 段）和消除 \"eval 数据太少/太特殊\" 的 reviewer 质疑。\n      (2) distribution shift 是 teacher-forcing→autoregressive 的结构性问题，\n      与 eval 数据的具体内容无关——任何多轮对话在推理时都会面临相同的 distribution mismatch。\n      (3) TG 和 LoRA-only 的 Dongre GAR 差异预期在 ±0.003 以内（实际 0.001），\n      因为 gate 在推理时是 near-identity（mean 0.93-0.98），不产生有意义的功能差异。\n      PPL 略高于 standard eval（2.71 vs 2.63）是因为 unseen conversations 的 topic 分布\n      可能略偏离训练分布，但差异很小。gap ratio 32x（相比 standard eval 的 30x）\n      在统计波动范围内，进一步确认 training-inference gap 的稳健性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Held-out 4-way evaluation results\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-Dongre mid\", \"GAR-ours mid\", \"PPL\", \"NTP loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.004\", \"0.011\", \"4.35\", \"1.43\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.015\", \"0.013\", \"2.71\", \"0.96\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.012\", \"0.012\", \"2.69\", \"0.95\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.014\", \"0.013\", \"2.70\", \"0.96\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Held-out vs Standard eval consistency\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Standard (5 convs)\", \"Held-out (50 convs)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG Dongre mid GAR\", \"0.0157\", \"0.015\", \"-0.001\"]\n          - [\"LoRA Dongre mid GAR\", \"0.0137\", \"0.014\", \"+0.000\"]\n          - [\"TG - LoRA gap\", \"+0.002\", \"+0.001\", \"-0.001\"]\n          - [\"Gap ratio (train/infer)\", \"30x\", \"32x\", \"+2x\"]\n          - [\"Base Dongre mid GAR\", \"0.003\", \"0.004\", \"+0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Held-out GAR 衰减曲线 (50段对话的 mean±std)，turn-by-turn，4条线重叠。Error bar 比 standard eval 更窄（样本量 10x）。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Held-out vs Standard eval 的 scatter plot (x=standard, y=held-out)，每点一个 model×metric，预期高度沿对角线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      50 段 held-out 对话确认：(1) TG Dongre GAR 0.015 与 standard eval 的 0.016 一致（±0.001），\n      training-inference gap ratio 32x；(2) TG - LoRA 差异 = 0.001，在 ±0.003 range 内，\n      gating 零增量贡献；(3) PPL 结果同样一致。\n      更大样本量使 error bar 收窄，增强了 \"gating 无效\" 结论的统计信度。\n      论文中这组数据放在 Section 6 作为 robustness check，\n      回应 reviewer 对 eval 数据过少/过拟合的潜在质疑。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR degradation diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 上运行 Phase 1 GAR 诊断，使用相同的 standard_conversations\n      （需适配 Llama-3 chat template），确认 GAR 衰减在不同架构族上存在。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_turn1_avg_gar: 0.0385\n      llama3_mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0098\n      llama3_relative_drop: 0.745\n      llama3_per_turn_avg_gar: [0.0385, 0.0218, 0.0195, 0.0108, 0.0115, 0.0072, 0.0064, 0.0068, 0.0131, 0.0051]\n      llama3_num_layers: 32\n      llama3_vs_qwen_drop_delta: \"+3.7pp (74.5% vs 70.8%)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 与 Qwen-2.5-7B 参数量相近（8B vs 7B）但架构不同\n      （GQA vs MHA、RoPE 实现差异、不同 pre-training 数据）。GAR 衰减是 autoregressive\n      transformer 在长 context 下的通用现象——随 turn 增加，goal tokens 在 KV cache 中的\n      positional recency 下降，attention softmax 自然稀释 goal attention。\n      因此 Llama 预期展现同等甚至略强的衰减（74.5% vs 70.8%），因为 GQA 的 shared KV heads\n      可能进一步压缩 per-head goal representation capacity。\n      turn-by-turn 趋势预期高度相似：turn 1 最高，turn 2-3 快速下降，turn 4+ 趋于平台。\n      这直接支撑 C1 的跨模型泛化：GAR 衰减不是 Qwen 特有的，而是 transformer attention 的通用特征。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 vs Qwen Phase 1 GAR comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Turn\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B GAR\", \"Llama-3.1-8B GAR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"T1\", \"0.0418\", \"0.0385\"]\n          - [\"T2\", \"0.0241\", \"0.0218\"]\n          - [\"T3\", \"0.0224\", \"0.0195\"]\n          - [\"T4\", \"0.0130\", \"0.0108\"]\n          - [\"T5\", \"0.0133\", \"0.0115\"]\n          - [\"T6\", \"0.0086\", \"0.0072\"]\n          - [\"T7\", \"0.0078\", \"0.0064\"]\n          - [\"T8\", \"0.0080\", \"0.0068\"]\n          - [\"T9\", \"0.0157\", \"0.0131\"]\n          - [\"T10\", \"0.0064\", \"0.0051\"]\n          - [\"Mid avg\", \"0.0122\", \"0.0098\"]\n          - [\"Relative drop\", \"70.8%\", \"74.5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 双模型 GAR 衰减曲线 (x=turn, y=GAR)，两条线形状几乎平行，Llama 略低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 的 74.5% GAR 衰减与 Qwen 的 70.8% 高度一致，\n      确认 GAR 衰减是跨架构族的通用现象。轻微差异（+3.7pp）在模型差异预期范围内。\n      这为后续跨模型 gating 实验建立了 baseline。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 Qwen v7 的完整训练 setup (MSE+gate_div, 3 epochs)，\n      验证训练收敛 + 推理失败的 pattern 跨模型复现。Llama 有 32 层（vs Qwen 28 层）。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_training_gar_peak: 0.42\n      llama3_final_avg_ntp: 0.91\n      llama3_final_avg_gar_loss: 0.001\n      llama3_final_gate_mean: 0.941\n      llama3_final_gate_std: 0.045\n      llama3_final_gate_min: 0.802\n      llama3_final_gate_max: 0.991\n      llama3_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-90):plateau@0.02 B(gs90-170):rapid_rise C(gs170+):converged@0.42\"\n      llama3_training_time_hours: 6.8\n      llama3_reversed_layers: 26  # /32\n      llama3_reversed_layers_frac: 0.8125\n      llama3_eval_dongre_mid_gar: 0.012\n      llama3_eval_ours_mid_gar: 0.013\n      llama3_inference_gap_ratio: 35  # 0.42 / 0.012 = 35x\n      llama3_gate_direction: \"WRONG: same reversal as Qwen\"\n      llama3_gate_dynamic_range_top3:\n        L25: { turn1: 0.782, turn21: 0.976, diff: -0.194 }\n        L16: { turn1: 0.761, turn21: 0.935, diff: -0.174 }\n        L8: { turn1: 0.831, turn21: 0.952, diff: -0.121 }\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3 training GAR peak 预期为 0.42（略低于 Qwen 的 0.48），原因：\n      (1) Llama-3 的 GQA (8 KV heads vs Qwen 的 28 full MHA heads) 意味着 gate 对 attention\n      的间接影响路径更窄——每个 KV head 服务多个 query head，gate 调制 residual stream 后，\n      attention shift 需要穿透 GQA 的 sharing 结构，效率略低；\n      (2) Llama 的 RoPE 频率不同，positional encoding 与 Qwen 的 NTK-aware RoPE 不同，\n      可能影响 turn-boundary 位置信号的传播。\n      但 MSE+gate_div loss 的核心动力学不依赖具体架构——bidirectional MSE 在任何可微分 gate\n      上都能驱动 training GAR 趋向 target，gate_div 防止 collapse。因此训练仍然收敛。\n      推理时 GAR = 0.012 极低（gap ratio 35x），原因与 Qwen 相同：teacher-forcing 训练的\n      attention pattern 不迁移到 autoregressive generation。\n      Gate direction 反转（26/32 层）同样复现 NF1，因为 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是 joint optimization\n      的通用特征，不依赖特定架构。收敛速度略慢（gs170 vs gs144）是因为 32 层的参数空间更大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 vs Qwen v7 training comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Num layers\", \"28\", \"32\"]\n          - [\"Attention type\", \"MHA (28 heads)\", \"GQA (32q/8kv)\"]\n          - [\"Training GAR peak\", \"0.48\", \"0.42\"]\n          - [\"GAR convergence step\", \"gs144\", \"gs170\"]\n          - [\"Final gate mean\", \"0.934\", \"0.941\"]\n          - [\"Final NTP loss\", \"0.896\", \"0.910\"]\n          - [\"Inference Dongre GAR\", \"0.016\", \"0.012\"]\n          - [\"Gap ratio\", \"30x\", \"35x\"]\n          - [\"Reversed layers\", \"27/28 (96%)\", \"26/32 (81%)\"]\n          - [\"Training time\", \"5.9h\", \"6.8h\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 gate profile top-5 reversed layers\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"Turn1 gate\", \"Turn21 gate\", \"Diff\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L25\", \"0.782\", \"0.976\", \"-0.194\"]\n          - [\"L16\", \"0.761\", \"0.935\", \"-0.174\"]\n          - [\"L8\", \"0.831\", \"0.952\", \"-0.121\"]\n          - [\"L12\", \"0.845\", \"0.961\", \"-0.116\"]\n          - [\"L5\", \"0.868\", \"0.973\", \"-0.105\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Llama-3 training GAR 曲线，展示同样的三阶段动力学 (plateau → rapid rise → convergence)。与 Qwen 曲线并列对比。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Llama-3 per-layer gate profile (turn1 vs turn21)，32 层中 26 层展现反向 turn conditioning。\"\n      - \"Fig C: 双模型 gate reversal 对比 bar chart (每层 diff)，形状相似但 Llama 有更多层可比较。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 完整复现了 Qwen 的三阶失败链：训练收敛（GAR 0.42）→ 推理失败（GAR 0.012，35x gap）→\n      gate 方向反转（81% 层）。training GAR 略低和 reversed fraction 略低（81% vs 96%）\n      与 GQA 架构差异一致，但核心 pattern 相同。这是跨模型验证的核心数据，\n      直接证明 distribution shift 是架构无关的结构性障碍（C5）。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上训练 LoRA-only baseline（无 gate，gate 固定为 1.0），\n      作为跨模型消融的对照组，隔离 gating 机制的增量贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_lora_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_lora_global_steps: 3000\n      llama3_lora_training_time_hours: 6.2\n      llama3_lora_final_ntp_loss: 0.908\n      llama3_lora_size_mb: 20\n      llama3_lora_gate_type: \"none (fixed 1.0)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 在 Llama 上的训练行为应与 Qwen 完全对称：纯 NTP 优化，无 GAR auxiliary loss。\n      NTP loss 收敛到相似水平（0.908 vs Qwen 的 0.948）——Llama 基础 NTP 略低是因为\n      Llama-3.1 的 pre-training 数据质量和规模不同。训练时间略长（6.2h vs 5.7h）是\n      因为 32 层（vs 28 层）带来更多 LoRA 参数。\n      这个实验本身不产生新 insight，但为 plan_012 的三路 eval 提供必要 baseline。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LoRA-only training comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epochs\", \"3\", \"3\"]\n          - [\"Final NTP loss\", \"0.948\", \"0.908\"]\n          - [\"Training time\", \"5.7h\", \"6.2h\"]\n          - [\"LoRA size\", \"20MB\", \"20MB\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练正常完成，为 plan_012 的三路 eval 提供 LoRA-only baseline checkpoint。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-way eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上用 held-out 数据执行三路 eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)，\n      计算 GAR-Dongre + GAR-ours + PPL。验证 gating 零增量贡献跨模型成立。\n      注意：Llama 跳过 UG 消融（Qwen 已证明 UG≈TG≈LoRA，跨模型只需确认核心 pattern）。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.003\n      llama3_base_ppl: 4.51\n      llama3_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.012\n      llama3_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.011\n      llama3_tg_ppl: 2.78\n      llama3_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.013\n      llama3_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.012\n      llama3_lora_ppl: 2.76\n      llama3_tg_minus_lora_dongre_gar: -0.001\n      llama3_gap_ratio: 35  # training 0.42 / inference 0.012\n      llama3_gating_incremental_benefit: \"none\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3 eval 预期精确复现 Qwen 的核心 pattern：\n      (1) Base GAR 极低（0.003），与 Qwen base（0.003）一致——这是 untrained model 在 Dongre\n      定义下的 GAR floor，主要由 random attention 决定；\n      (2) TG 和 LoRA-only 的 Dongre GAR 差异 = -0.001，在 ±0.003 range 内——\n      因为推理时 gate 是 near-identity（0.94），功能上等价于 LoRA-only；\n      (3) PPL 在三个 trained model 间几乎相同（2.76-2.78），因为 NTP loss 主导训练，\n      gate 对 NTP 的影响 <0.5%。\n      Gap ratio 35x（训练 0.42 / 推理 0.012）比 Qwen 的 30x 略大，\n      与 Llama GQA 架构下 attention pattern 更难被间接调制一致。\n      这组数据与 Qwen 的四路 eval 联合，构成 C4+C5 的跨模型证据：\n      gating 在两个架构族上都没有增量贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 3-way eval\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-Dongre mid\", \"GAR-ours mid\", \"PPL\", \"NTP loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.003\", \"0.009\", \"4.51\", \"1.46\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.012\", \"0.011\", \"2.78\", \"0.92\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.013\", \"0.012\", \"2.76\", \"0.91\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model gating contribution summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG Dongre GAR\", \"0.016\", \"0.012\"]\n          - [\"LoRA Dongre GAR\", \"0.014\", \"0.013\"]\n          - [\"TG - LoRA\", \"+0.002\", \"-0.001\"]\n          - [\"Gap ratio\", \"30x\", \"35x\"]\n          - [\"Gating benefit\", \"none\", \"none\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Cross-model 4-panel comparison: Qwen 四路 + Llama 三路的 GAR 衰减曲线并列。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Gap ratio bar chart (Qwen 30x vs Llama 35x)，展示跨模型一致性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 三路 eval 确认跨模型结论：gating 零增量贡献（TG - LoRA = -0.001），\n      gap ratio 35x。两个架构族的 convergent evidence 直接回应 W1（单模型弱点），\n      将论文从 \"单模型 observation\" 升级为 \"跨架构 structural finding\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B gradient conflict analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3 v7 checkpoint 上执行梯度冲突分析，验证 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争跨模型成立。\n      32 层 × 至少 1 个 checkpoint（优先 epoch 2 final）。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_epoch2_mean_cos_sim: -0.058\n      llama3_epoch2_layers_negative: 27  # /32\n      llama3_epoch2_mean_mag_ratio: 12.8\n      llama3_epoch2_max_mag_ratio: 18.5\n      llama3_worst_conflict_layers: \"L5, L8, L12, L16\"\n      llama3_cos_sim_std: 0.038\n    result_rationale: >\n      NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是 joint optimization 的通用属性：NTP 推 gate→1.0（minimize 对 residual\n      的干扰），GAR 推 gate→0（maximize attention redistribution）。这个对抗不依赖\n      具体的 attention 实现（MHA vs GQA）或 positional encoding（RoPE variant），\n      因为它发生在 gate parameter space 而非 attention space。\n      Llama 的 mean cos_sim (-0.058) 与 Qwen (-0.045) 同级，略更负可能因为 GQA 架构下\n      GAR loss 对 gate 的间接梯度路径更复杂（穿透 shared KV heads），\n      导致梯度方向偏移更大。mag_ratio 12.8x 在 Qwen 的 14.2x 附近，\n      反映类似的 NTP 主导程度。27/32 层负 cos_sim（84%）与 Qwen 的 26/28（93%）\n      在同一 range，略低因为 Llama 有更多 \"浅层\" gate（L28-L31）受 GAR 影响更弱、\n      cos_sim 可能为微弱正值。\n      跨模型梯度数据联合构成 SP2 的完整证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model gradient conflict comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B (ep2)\", \"Llama-3.1-8B (ep2)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Mean cos_sim\", \"-0.045\", \"-0.058\"]\n          - [\"Std cos_sim\", \"0.035\", \"0.038\"]\n          - [\"Layers cos<0\", \"26/28 (93%)\", \"27/32 (84%)\"]\n          - [\"Mean mag_ratio\", \"14.2x\", \"12.8x\"]\n          - [\"Max mag_ratio\", \"19.1x\", \"18.5x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 双模型 per-layer cos_sim bar chart (Qwen 28层 vs Llama 32层)，均以 y=0 为分界，负值标蓝。\"\n      - \"Fig B: 双模型 mag_ratio 曲线叠加，展示 NTP 主导程度跨模型一致。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 梯度冲突 pattern 与 Qwen 高度一致（cos_sim 同为负，mag_ratio 同量级），\n      证明 NTP-GAR 梯度竞争是 joint NTP+auxiliary loss 训练的通用特征（不依赖特定架构）。\n      这是 \"distribution shift 是结构性的\" 论证的梯度层面证据。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream task sanity check (instruction retention)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      设计简单下游任务：在 system prompt 给出格式指令（如 \"每次回复以 [DONE] 结尾\"），\n      测试 4 个模型在 10 turn 对话中遵循该指令的比例。验证 GAR 衰减与可观察的任务性能退化相关联。\n    expected_results:\n      task_type: \"instruction_retention_rate\"\n      num_instructions: 5\n      num_conversations_per_instruction: 10\n      num_turns: 10\n      base_turn1_compliance: 0.82\n      base_turn10_compliance: 0.34\n      base_compliance_drop: 0.585  # (0.82-0.34)/0.82\n      tg_turn1_compliance: 0.84\n      tg_turn10_compliance: 0.36\n      tg_compliance_drop: 0.571\n      lora_turn1_compliance: 0.84\n      lora_turn10_compliance: 0.35\n      lora_compliance_drop: 0.583\n      gar_compliance_correlation: 0.89  # Pearson r between GAR and compliance across turns\n      tg_vs_lora_compliance_diff: \"+1pp (noise)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      System prompt instruction compliance 随 turn 下降是 GAR 衰减的直接行为后果：\n      model 的 attention 越来越难访问 system prompt 中的 goal tokens，\n      导致格式指令的 \"记忆\" 衰退。Base model compliance 从 82% 降到 34%（~59% drop）\n      与 GAR 70.8% drop 趋势一致（compliance drop 略小是因为 residual stream 仍保留部分\n      goal info，即使 attention 衰减，model 仍有概率通过 MLP/skip connection 间接访问）。\n      TG 和 LoRA-only 的 compliance 几乎相同（36% vs 35%），因为推理时 gate 是 near-identity，\n      不影响实际生成行为。GAR-compliance 相关系数 0.89 建立了 GAR 作为 proxy metric 的\n      behavioral validity，回应 W3（GAR 是否与真实任务性能相关）。\n      best 档下这个相关性足够高（>0.85）使 reviewer 接受 GAR 作为合理 proxy。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction compliance across turns\"\n        columns: [\"Turn\", \"Base\", \"TG\", \"LoRA-only\", \"Mean GAR (Base)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"T1\", \"0.82\", \"0.84\", \"0.84\", \"0.042\"]\n          - [\"T2\", \"0.74\", \"0.76\", \"0.75\", \"0.024\"]\n          - [\"T3\", \"0.68\", \"0.69\", \"0.68\", \"0.022\"]\n          - [\"T4\", \"0.62\", \"0.63\", \"0.62\", \"0.013\"]\n          - [\"T5\", \"0.56\", \"0.57\", \"0.56\", \"0.013\"]\n          - [\"T6\", \"0.50\", \"0.51\", \"0.50\", \"0.009\"]\n          - [\"T7\", \"0.44\", \"0.45\", \"0.44\", \"0.008\"]\n          - [\"T8\", \"0.40\", \"0.42\", \"0.41\", \"0.008\"]\n          - [\"T9\", \"0.38\", \"0.39\", \"0.38\", \"0.016\"]\n          - [\"T10\", \"0.34\", \"0.36\", \"0.35\", \"0.006\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Compliance-GAR correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Pearson r\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.89\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.87\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.88\", \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Dual-axis plot: compliance rate (左轴, bars) + GAR (右轴, line) across turns, 展示同步衰减。\"\n      - \"Fig B: Scatter plot GAR vs compliance (per turn, per model)，regression line + r² annotation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Instruction compliance 随 turn 衰减 (~59%) 与 GAR 衰减 (~71%) 同步，Pearson r = 0.89，\n      建立 GAR 作为 behavioral proxy 的 empirical validity。关键是 TG 和 LoRA-only\n      的 compliance 几乎相同（Δ ≈ 1pp），与 GAR 结论一致——gating 不改善实际任务表现。\n      这组数据回应 W3（GAR 是否代表真实性能），建议放在 Section 6 或 Appendix 作为\n      supplementary evidence。注意这不是 comprehensive downstream eval，\n      而是 sanity check，论文中需要诚实地定位为 \"preliminary behavioral validation\"。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a2798eb8-f7f1-44c1-8b40-8064e4595dc1","total_cost_usd":0.7462743999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21970,"cache_read_input_tokens":40846,"output_tokens":13204,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21970,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":12910,"cache_read_input_tokens":29005,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4806,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4806},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":12229,"outputTokens":7861,"cacheReadInputTokens":1050799,"cacheCreationInputTokens":81448,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2584239,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":3,"outputTokens":13204,"cacheReadInputTokens":40846,"cacheCreationInputTokens":21970,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4878504999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"d4b406a7-01a9-469d-a9d0-b75046a6265b"}
